<title>UK: KfW sets 500 mln mark December 2002 step-up bond.</title>
<headline>KfW sets 500 mln mark December 2002 step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SGZ-Bank</p>
<p> BORROWER   KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU (KFW)</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.125     MATURITY  **30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE   S21.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES    **UNTIL 30.DEC.97 WHEN COUPON STEPS UP TO 5.125 PCT</p>
<p>		IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1	   GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	INHABERSCHULDVERSCHREIBUNG REIHE 209</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
